# Word and Excel lock files. Office creates these next to a document while it
# is open and deletes them on close, so they are pure noise, and committing one
# publishes a stray binary to the live site.
#
# Note for future sessions: kit .docx files used to be tracked here and served to
# buyers. They are not any more. PDF is the consumer deliverable; .docx is an
# internal and provider-network asset (Nexus white-labeling) and lives in the
# program folder in the workspace repo, not on the public site.
~$*

